+config PCIE_ALPINE_V3
+	bool "Annapurna Labs Alpine V3 external PCIe root complex"
+	depends on ARM64
+	help
+	  Root complex driver for the external PCIe ports of Annapurna Labs
+	  (Amazon) Alpine V3 SoCs ("amazon,al-alpine-v3-pcie"), on Annapurna's
+	  HAL built for Alpine V3 (PCIe unit rev 4, AVG SerDes lanes). A link
+	  that firmware already trained is kept; otherwise the port is brought
+	  up as an RC as the vendor U-Boot does it (DT amazon,link-gen,
+	  amazon,link-lanes, amazon,serdes-lanes), with its width/Gen1 fallback.
