+	 * Values in Device Passthrough mode mapping
+	 * [0] set
+	 * [1] set
+	 * [12] set
+	 * [14:13]: 2'01
+	 *
+	 * LLC attributes
+	 * [16] Map inbound TH bit (from TPH) to LLC allocate hint, otherwise by address[50]
+	 * [17] Map inbound ST[0] bit (from TPH) to LLC Padding hint, otherwise by address[51]
+	 *
+	 */
